- op: discuss  # 1e66
  at: '2026-04-16T00:26:04Z'  # 1e66
  by: agent  # 1e66
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 1e66
  clock: 6  # 1e66
  nonce: '1e66'  # 1e66
  message: "Fixed in commit 9d7349e20 (PR #3048). py.py marks CBV registrations with is_class_based_view=True and emits http_method=ANY; new framework_patterns.expand_class_based_view_routes post-pass walks the global symbol list, builds ClassName -> declared HTTP methods index from Cls.<method> symbols, and replaces each ANY route with one variant per declared method. Cross-file unresolved CBVs stay as ANY (honest unknown beats false GET). Verified on 4-class re_path repro: GET/POST/DELETE/PATCH+PUT all correctly emitted."  # 1e66
